#. Translators: 1 - To prevent a greedy regular expression you can use
#. <code>^/</code>, 2 - to anchor it to the start of the Query Arg. For
#. example: <code>^</code>.
#: languages/aioseo-lite.php:7095 dist/Lite/assets/js/Advanced.BQoDn4oV.js:1
